# Buster Sword: "that damage" is the damage actually dealt. Benalish Hero equipped is 4/3, but Bot2's Healing Salve prevents 3 of
# it, so 1 damage is dealt (CR 615.6): the trigger draws, and only a spell with mana value 1 or less may be cast free. Ancestral
# Recall (MV 1) may; Hop to It (MV 3, below the Hero's power of 4) may not (the refusal, with Ancestral Recall the positive control).

